Package: hp34401a-gui
Version: 1.1.4
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 0
Depends: libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.4), libqt6serialport6 (>= 6.4)
Maintainer: Kalle Hagen <dev@hammarang-solutions.se>
Homepage: https://git.cls.net/kalle/Agilent_34401a_GUI
Description: Linux GUI for HP/Agilent/Keysight 34401A Multimeter
 Control software for the HP/Agilent/Keysight 34401A digital multimeter
 via RS-232 serial connection.
 .
 Supports all 10 measurement modes (VDC, ADC, VAC, AAC, 2W/4W resistance,
 frequency, period, diode and continuity) with live display, MIN/MAX/AVG
 statistics and configurable sampling rate. Includes an OBS streaming
 overlay with chroma-key background.
